{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch, Rest, Repeat is a cozy idle boxing game that sits at the bottom of your screen. Play while working, studying, or relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/a2cd04322aa3ca1e71c74bc13e3416b7.poster.avif?t=1766398923\" width=788 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/a2cd04322aa3ca1e71c74bc13e3416b7.webm?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/a2cd04322aa3ca1e71c74bc13e3416b7.mp4?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train hard to become a stronger boxer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join fights and tournaments to earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings to upgrade your equipment and improve your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/447732f13693fefe125d921c7b7bcf82.poster.avif?t=1766398923\" width=902 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/447732f13693fefe125d921c7b7bcf82.webm?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/447732f13693fefe125d921c7b7bcf82.mp4?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own workout plan to boost your champion\u2019s stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/d1a452b4f8cb01430b084a8db97945c1.poster.avif?t=1766398923\" width=844 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/d1a452b4f8cb01430b084a8db97945c1.webm?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/d1a452b4f8cb01430b084a8db97945c1.mp4?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make progress through training and watch your fighter grow stronger day by day. One punch at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face rivals in random challenges and join tournaments to become a champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/94926c4722c61562b0a80a976baf091c.poster.avif?t=1766398923\" width=882 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/94926c4722c61562b0a80a976baf091c.webm?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/94926c4722c61562b0a80a976baf091c.mp4?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win matches, earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest well. So you can train even harder next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch. Rest. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Boxer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi