10/9cde20ac1c4f4c3f6dd7dc026adb345f54191694/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766398923","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch, Rest, Repeat is a cozy idle boxing game that sits at the bottom of your screen. Play while working, studying, or relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/a2cd04322aa3ca1e71c74bc13e3416b7.poster.avif?t=1766398923\" width=788 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/a2cd04322aa3ca1e71c74bc13e3416b7.webm?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/a2cd04322aa3ca1e71c74bc13e3416b7.mp4?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train hard to become a stronger boxer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join fights and tournaments to earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings to upgrade your equipment and improve your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/447732f13693fefe125d921c7b7bcf82.poster.avif?t=1766398923\" width=902 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095710/extras/447732f13693fefe125d921c7b7bcf82.webm?t=1766398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_